{
  "id": "coordinated-replan-sealed-holdout-v1",
  "split": "sealed_holdout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "empty-day-coordinated-three-meals-edit",
      "fixture": "empty_day",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "今天重新安排18分钟训练和三餐，先看整体方案。早餐只吃玉米80克、鸡蛋100克；午餐鸡胸肉140克、米饭180克、西兰花160克；晚餐豆腐200克、菠菜140克、红薯160克。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "done_sets": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "确定放弃原来的安排，接着制定新目标，先让我预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "max_minutes": 18,
            "foods": {
              "breakfast": {
                "玉米": 80,
                "鸡蛋": 100
              },
              "lunch": {
                "鸡胸肉": 140,
                "米饭": 180,
                "西兰花": 160
              },
              "dinner": {
                "豆腐": 200,
                "菠菜": 140,
                "红薯": 160
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "训练和午晚餐都照原草案，早餐玉米改为50克燕麦，鸡蛋仍然100克，先别应用。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "max_minutes": 18,
            "foods": {
              "breakfast": {
                "燕麦": 50,
                "鸡蛋": 100
              },
              "lunch": {
                "鸡胸肉": 140,
                "米饭": 180,
                "西兰花": 160
              },
              "dinner": {
                "豆腐": 200,
                "菠菜": 140,
                "红薯": 160
              }
            },
            "same_draft": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "修改后的这版没问题，现在确认应用。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 0,
            "completed": false,
            "max_minutes": 18,
            "foods": {
              "breakfast": {
                "燕麦": 50,
                "鸡蛋": 100
              },
              "lunch": {
                "鸡胸肉": 140,
                "米饭": 180,
                "西兰花": 160
              },
              "dinner": {
                "豆腐": 200,
                "菠菜": 140,
                "红薯": 160
              }
            },
            "same_draft": true,
            "apply": true,
            "meal_scopes": [
              "breakfast",
              "lunch",
              "dinner"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "再核对一下早餐的燕麦几克，以及新训练当前完成了几组。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 0,
            "completed": false,
            "reply_contains": [
              "燕麦",
              "50",
              "0"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "preserved-records-workout-only",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "旧计划没练完的先不补，练过的记录别删，今天换成14分钟的新训练，餐食全都别动。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "done_sets": 7
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "同意保留实际记录并放弃旧剩余，给我看看新的训练目标。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 7,
            "max_minutes": 14
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "等一下，先留着这份预览，暂时不应用。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 7,
            "max_minutes": 14,
            "same_draft": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "这回看好了，就应用刚才保留的那版。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true,
            "same_draft": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "分开告诉我旧记录合计多少组、新训练现在做了多少组，我还没开始新这套。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "explain_separation": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}